WEBVTT

00:06:58.083 --> 00:07:00.934
from what's called a multiple
equivalent simultaneous offer.

00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.833
Say that five times fast.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.726
For example, if you care
about salary, bonus and location,

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:12.726
you present one offer with a high salary,
but small bonus and unpopular location

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.809
and another with a more moderate salary

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:17.768
and a bigger bonus
and more desirable location.

00:07:17.792 --> 00:07:20.726
It increases the odds
that both sides find a combination

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.042
that works for them.

00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:28.684
Of course, the credibility
of your offers depends

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:31.934
on having a legitimate
rationale to back them up.